            <ArticleTitle>[Data on experience with automated diagnostic systems].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3162-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study highlights the various parameters considered for experimenting automatic equipment correctly. By applying such parameters to experiments with the &quot;Sicard&quot; system (Siemens) for automatic ECG reading, the usefulness of the system for its declared purpose, i.e. mass screening and epidemiological research, has been demonstrated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
